cpc_bid_ceiling.description:
Maximum CPC, in the account's currency. Required
for TARGET_IMPRESSION_SHARE, optional for MAXIMIZE_CLICKS,
rejected by the conversion-based strategies.

modifiers.description:
Device name to multiplier, e.g.
{"MOBILE": 1.2, "DESKTOP": 0.8, "TABLET": 0}
Valid devices: MOBILE, DESKTOP, TABLET, CONNECTED_TV.

tools.description:
Discards an open plan so it can never be applied.

Nothing in the account changes. An applied plan cannot be discarded;
its rollback recipe is the way back.
